  "description": "The AI Picker wraps the ai-picker-trigger atom with an AI suggestion layer and a calendar/time popover. It consolidates four picker types (date, month, month-range, time) and four density variants that progressively add AI signals, rationale, and governance controls. Core principle: AI suggests, human decides — the suggestion is always shown for review and never auto-applied. The date type reuses DSDatePickerInline; month, month-range, and time use brand-styled inline panels.",
